<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title></title>
</head>
<body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Op dit moment zijn er al verschillende voorbeelden te vinden in Nederland. Zo zijn er zowel op hogescholen als op universiteiten transdisciplinaire vakken te vinden. Een aantal voorbeelden van transdisciplinair onderwijs:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">In de minor </span><a style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 0px" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.avans.nl/international/studying/programmes/act-for-change-together/exchange/introduction"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Act for Change Together</span></span></a><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"> van Avans</span><span style="margin: 0px"> hogeschool werken studenten van verschillende disciplines samen met stakeholders aan maatschappelijke vraagstukken rondom nieuwe economie: </span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Bij Hogeschool NHL Stenden kunnen studenten midden in de wijk deelnemen aan het project </span><a style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 0px" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.nhlstenden.com/projecten/social-innovation-lab"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Social Innovation Lab</span></span></a><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> waarbij ze met wijkbewoners hun praktijk meteen samen kunnen toepassen.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">In de master insert </span><a style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 0px" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.utwente.nl/en/education/master/programmes/transdisciplinary-master-insert/"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px">Shaping Responsible Futures</span></span></a><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px"> aan</span><span style="margin: 0px"> de Universiteit van Twente werken</span><span style="margin: 0px"> studenten</span><span style="margin: 0px"> samen</span><span style="margin: 0px"> met de gemeente</span><span style="margin: 0px">, ngo's</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of bedrijven</span><span style="margin: 0px"> aan</span><span style="margin: 0px"> vragstukken</span><span style="margin: 0px"> over verantwoordelijke</span><span style="margin: 0px"> toekomsten</span><span style="margin: 0px"> en</span><span style="margin: 0px"> systemische</span><span style="margin: 0px"> veranderingen</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">I het keuzevak </span><a style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 0px" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://placemakingamsterdam.nl/"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Placemaking</span></span></a><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> aan de Universiteit van Amsterdam gaan verschillende studenten aan de slag met buurtbewoners en stakeholders om stedelijke problemen aan te pakken en gezamenlijk een antwoord te bieden.&nbsp;</span></p></body>
</html>